## Codex adaptation

This distribution adapts danweinerdev/claude-model-router v0.3.0, commit
7091881a48136cf06b3a483399dd370b1f7d9360 (MIT).
Source: https://github.com/danweinerdev/claude-model-router

The five role instructions and the routing/verification/escalation policy are
adapted from the upstream agents and routing skill. Claude Code hooks, commands,
agent frontmatter, and hard-coded cost estimates are not used by this port.
The Codex CLI adapter, Python state machine, schema validation, project installer,
native Codex TOML generation, and offline integration tests are new implementation.
The preceding origin table describes the upstream work, not files shipped here.
